# soc/drivers/bt/conf: the SDM845's WCN3990, its Bluetooth half (a UART on QUP0 SE6).

driver BT6T
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.bt6t.c
	file    iokit/Kernel/hakios.bt6t_ioreg.cpp iokitcpp
	help    the WCN3990's Bluetooth over its UART: bt6t=1..4 bring-up steps (firmware, address, scans); bt6t=5 hands the
	help    controller to Darwin as /dev/cu.bluetooth (H4) and the IOService "bluetooth" bluetoothd looks for
